      en: ["De Willem is located in Region 3, along the West Coast Demerara highway.", "The village is named after a former Dutch sugar plantation.", "It is situated between the communities of Zeeburg and Meten-Meer-Zorg.", "The area is historically significant for its contributions to the sugar industry.", "The local population is largely of Indo-Guyanese heritage.", "It serves as a residential area for workers at the nearby sugar estates."],
      es: ["De Willem se encuentra en la región de Essequibo Islands-West Demerara.", "El nombre es de origen neerlandés y hace referencia a la historia colonial.", "El asentamiento está situado directamente en la West Coast Highway.", "Históricamente, el lugar formaba parte del extenso cinturón de caña de azúcar de Guyana.", "Se encuentra muy cerca de la escuela secundaria Zeeburg Secondary School.", "La población está compuesta principalmente por descendientes de trabajadores indios contratados."],
