      en: ["Goed Fortuin is situated on the West Bank of the Demerara River in Region 3.", "The name is of Dutch origin, meaning 'Good Fortune.'", "The village is positioned between the communities of Pouderoyen and Schoonord.", "It was historically established as a sugar plantation during the Dutch era.", "The community is home to several primary and secondary educational institutions.", "Its location makes it a popular residential area for West Bank commuters."],
